  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A stone of mass m is projected vertically upwards with speed u from the top of a cliff. The speed of the stone when it is just about to hit the ground is v.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the magnitude of the change in momentum of the stone?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\\frac{v+u}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\\frac{v-u}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"mv+u\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"mv-u\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
